Source: openkylin-xr-integration
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Maintainer: openKylin XR SIG <xr@lists.openkylin.top>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Vcs-Git: https://github.com/bitsk/openkylin-xr-integration.git
Vcs-Browser: https://github.com/bitsk/openkylin-xr-integration

Package: openkylin-xr-defaults
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: XR distribution integration and model definitions
 Independently maintained XR component for openKylin integration.

Package: xr-device-a081
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, openkylin-xr-defaults, firmware-xr-a081
Description: A081 board audio sensors and thermal integration
 Independently maintained XR component for openKylin integration.

Package: xr-device-a081-vr
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, xr-device-a081, firmware-xr-a081-tracking, xr-vendor-a081-controller, xr-vendor-a081-dsp-host
Description: A081 tracking resources and VR backend selection
 Independently maintained XR component for openKylin integration.

Package: openkylin-xr-base
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, libopenxr-loader1, pipewire, wireplumber
Description: XR common runtime integration
 Independently maintained XR component for openKylin integration.

Package: openkylin-xr-streaming
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, openkylin-xr-base, wivrn, wayvr, openkylin-xr-panel
Description: XR streaming desktop package selection
 Independently maintained XR component for openKylin integration.

Package: openkylin-xr-debug
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, openkylin-xr-base, xr-debug-server, xr-debug-web
Description: XR debugging package selection
 Independently maintained XR component for openKylin integration.

Package: openkylin-xr-steamvr
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, openkylin-xr-base, xr-monado-steamvr-driver, xr-head-tracking, xr-controller-worker-bionic, xr-session-manager
Description: XR SteamVR candidate component selection
 Installs independently maintained components without activating a session.

Package: openkylin-xr-hands
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, openkylin-xr-base, xr-hand-tracking (>= 0.1.3), xr-head-tracking (>= 0.1.2), xr-monado-steamvr-driver (>= 25.0.0+xr4), xr-session-manager (>= 0.1.3), xr-shell (>= 0.2.30), xr-system-ui (>= 0.2.14)
Suggests: xr-hand-backend-quest-dsp
Description: Optional XR optical hand input package selection
 Installs the hand input service and compatible session/runtime interfaces.
 Activation is explicit. Proprietary backend assets and private calibration
 are supplied separately, and installation never starts a camera session.

Package: openkylin-xr-native
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, openkylin-xr-base, xr-device-a081-vr, xr-shell-session (>= 0.1.26), xr-shell, xr-window-server, xr-dock, xr-system-ui, xr-head-tracking, xr-controller-worker-bionic, xr-device-tools, xr-session-manager, xr-monado-steamvr-driver, xr-native-interop, xr-hexagonrpc-daemon
Recommends: xr-environment-qingkong, xr-spatial-style-ukui, xwayland, fcitx5
Description: Native openKylin XR desktop component closure
 Selects the independently packaged native desktop, tracking consumers and
 sole device producer. Private calibration and upstream SteamVR resources
 are imported explicitly. Package installation does not activate XR.
